---
exclude_paths:
  # Legacy pre-molecule test playbook. It references the role by directory name
  # rather than rhythmictech.tomcat, so it cannot resolve; molecule/ supersedes
  # it. Remove the directory (and this entry) when convenient.
  - tests/

# These rules fail broadly across the role as it stands today. They are
# suppressed so the lint job enforces everything else rather than being
# switched off wholesale. This is a burn-down list, not a permanent exemption --
# delete entries as the role is modernized.
skip_list:
  # ~52 hits: bare module names (yum:, file:, template:, service:) that want
  # their ansible.builtin. prefix.
  - fqcn[action-core]
  # ~52 hits: task names start lowercase. Mechanical, but the role is
  # consistently lowercase, so changing it is churn better done in one pass.
  - name[casing]
  # ~12 hits: key=value free-form module calls, e.g. stat: path=/foo.
  - no-free-form
  # 2 hits: the role gates follow-up tasks on registered .changed results
  # instead of notifying handlers, deliberately -- consumers decide whether a
  # config change warrants a restart.
  - no-handler
